{"version":1,"key":"card:508","content":{"id":508,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"小白鼠试毒问题。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"问题：现在有 1000 瓶药水，其中有 1 瓶毒药，毒药药性发作致死时间为 1 小时。现在有 1 个小时的时间找出毒药，那么至少需要多少只小白鼠来试毒？假设药水量无限，可以无限稀释，喝药时间不计。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用十位二进制对 1000 瓶药水进行编号："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第一瓶药水编码为 0000000001"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"..."}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第一千瓶药水编码为 1111101000"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接着取每个位置编码为 1 的药水分别混合为一瓶药水，十位二进制就混合为十瓶药水，每瓶药水都使用一只老鼠进行试验，如果对应的老鼠死了，说明包含毒药，就说明毒药在该二进制位是 1，进而可以知道毒药瓶的二进制表示，从而知道哪瓶是毒药。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://fe.ecool.fun/topic/65d6d0c8-c15e-43d2-9e94-4fb86284fbd0","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"小白鼠试毒问题"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}],"tags":["智力题","面试题"],"createTime":1730027245624,"updateTime":1752893511734,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752893511734}}